  "body": "Yithian deck only. Permanent.\nYou can only play, commit, or trigger abilities on non-weakness non-story player cards if all the {Traits} on that card have been learned and/or are printed on your investigator.\n➡️ Reveal a non-weakness card from your hand, or choose a non-weakness card you control, and choose one of its {Traits}: Test 📚 (X). X is equal to half the {Traits} you have learned (rounded up). If you fail, discard that card. If you succeed, record that you have learned that {Trait}.",
